{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01530",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 5.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.79,
      "end_seconds": 10.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.67,
      "end_seconds": 21.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "Yeah, honestly, it's chest tightness when I walk uphill, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.7,
      "end_seconds": 30.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "how many days or weeks has it been? These questions might sound routine, but they matter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.34,
      "end_seconds": 34.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Ever since... since this morning, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.76,
      "end_seconds": 40.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.85,
      "end_seconds": 63.04,
      "duration_seconds": 21.19,
      "text": "Yes, cold weather. That makes it worse. A eight out of ten, I suppose. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I just want to get back to normal, really. Mm, you know, I've also had breathlessness on exertion, for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.98,
      "end_seconds": 81.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.55,
      "end_seconds": 92.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.41,
      "end_seconds": 127.85,
      "duration_seconds": 15.44,
      "text": "okay: weight 72 kilos, height 166 centimetres, blood pressure 127 over 69. And respiratory rate 18, SpO2 98 percent on room air, pulse is 69 beats a minute, temp 36.6 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.47,
      "end_seconds": 134.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.44,
      "end_seconds": 136.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.67,
      "end_seconds": 139.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.83,
      "end_seconds": 162.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Your heart sounds are normal and the pulses are all present."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.44,
      "end_seconds": 171.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Have you noticed fainting or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.58,
      "end_seconds": 176.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "No fainting or leg swelling, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.93,
      "end_seconds": 181.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "A few quick ones: pain at rest or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.97,
      "end_seconds": 190.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "I mean, I haven't had pain at rest or palpitations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.96,
      "end_seconds": 196.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "So, any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.3,
      "end_seconds": 199.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.34,
      "end_seconds": 203.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.08,
      "end_seconds": 209.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Um, you know, no, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.66,
      "end_seconds": 230.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "alright, have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.19,
      "end_seconds": 233.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.51,
      "end_seconds": 241.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.72,
      "end_seconds": 247.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.32,
      "end_seconds": 249.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.25,
      "end_seconds": 254.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "erm, nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.62,
      "end_seconds": 258.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.83,
      "end_seconds": 265.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.24,
      "end_seconds": 268.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.69,
      "end_seconds": 275.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.93,
      "end_seconds": 279.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.76,
      "end_seconds": 284.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.04,
      "end_seconds": 312.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably stable angina. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.99,
      "end_seconds": 317.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.97,
      "end_seconds": 325.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now stable angina is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.71,
      "end_seconds": 342.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "I'll request a cholesterol test, it'll help with heart risk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 343.11,
      "end_seconds": 345.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "The earliest is Monday, 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.35,
      "end_seconds": 352.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Monday, that that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.14,
      "end_seconds": 370.56,
      "duration_seconds": 16.42,
      "text": "You'll be taking glyceryl trinitrate spray, 400 micrograms, when needed, long term. That should help with chest tightness. Stop and rest when the tightness starts, and use the spray if it does not ease in a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.92,
      "end_seconds": 375.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "yes, carry on we'll refer you to the chest pain clinic"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.71,
      "end_seconds": 381.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Okay, so sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.53,
      "end_seconds": 391.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.74,
      "text": "please don't wait if the symptoms get worse that's when to be seen urgently let's plan a check after the tests"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.88,
      "end_seconds": 396.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Good, um, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.79,
      "end_seconds": 399.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.3,
      "end_seconds": 404.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Let me think, alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.25,
      "end_seconds": 407.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}